# ASR / Defender safe execution (mandatory)

This machine may block **Attack Surface Reduction** rules on low-prevalence venv shims
(`pip.exe`, `pip3.exe`, `pip3.11.exe`, etc.). Parent process may show as `svchost.exe`.

## Never use (agents, scripts, CI)

- `\.venv\Scripts\pip.exe` / `pip3.exe` / any `pip*.exe` in the venv
- `pip install` or `python -m pip install` in automated agent or repo scripts
- Subprocess or shell that spawns the above
- Installers, `uv pip`, `poetry run pip`, or downloading wheels from agent turns

## Always use

- **`$Root\.venv\Scripts\python.exe`** with a **script path** (e.g. `research\foo.py`, `scripts\run_backtest.py`)
- PowerShell wrappers already in `scripts\` that only call `python.exe`
- MT5: `scripts\run_backtest.py`, `scripts\install_ea.ps1` (MetaEditor), not pip

## Dependencies

- Base stack: install once offline per `docs/ML_INSTALL_IT.md` (admin allowlists **`python.exe`**, not pip).
- Missing imports: fail fast with a message pointing to that doc — **do not** auto-install.

## Docs

- `docs/ML_INSTALL_IT.md` — IT / ASR policy detail
- `AGENTS.md` — Commands section (canonical `python.exe` only)
